  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "TLS: Fall back to SHA-256 for calculating early secret from PSK",
  "description": "The early secret has to be calculated before the Server Hello and\nthus before the hash function is known. Per RFC 8864 4.2.1 and\nRFC 9258, fall back to SHA-256. Ideally we SHOULD associate all\nsupported external PSKs with a hash algorithm, which probably\nmeans using a UAT or similar.\n\nAlso add some more comments.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
